  "goodToKnow": "Der Haftbefehl is an arrest warrant: einen Haftbefehl erlassen (to issue one), ein internationaler Haftbefehl. In Germany, a judge must issue it; the police can only arrest without one in urgent cases. Die Haft is custody or detention: die Untersuchungshaft (U-Haft, remand), die Haftstrafe (prison sentence). Der Befehl is an order or command. Haftbefehl is also the stage name of a well-known German rapper."
